author: codex-audit-20260715
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: "pm plan create --help and --help --json resolve to action-specific help or an equally precise positional-action help view; pm help plan create and command-scoped contracts expose the same effective flags; shell completion advertises plan actions; pm plan --help no longer reports an empty subcommands array while describing subcommands only in a positional argument; documented pm plan create examples remain valid; regression tests cover help JSON, contracts, completion, and unknown-command recovery"
parent: pm-mpbb
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: "Positional plan and assurance actions are now first-class declared help/contract paths with action-specific flags, positionals, examples, completion, and bounded compact/full projections."
expected_result: "Agents can inspect every positional plan/assurance action before execution through direct help, generic help, completion, or command contracts without an unknown-command detour."
actual_result: "All 27 plan/assurance actions resolve through action-specific JSON/text help and full contracts; compact output remains bounded; focused, packed npm/Bun, grammar, and exact-coverage checks pass."
